- Population: HIV-positive people with cryptococcal meningitis
- Intervention: Early ART initiation (<4 weeks after antifungal treatment)
- Comparison: Delayed ART initiation (≥4 weeks after antifungal treatment)

INCLUDED STUDIES (1):
